  "selectionRule": "Include BOTH intermediate blockage counts, all seeds and policies regardless of benefit signs; not a prospectively registered formal hypothesis test.",
  "openControls": "Reuse same-seed B0 None raw baseline from completed r2; no duplication or new independent sample claim",
  "counterfactual": "Pair new OthersHelp with existing AllHelp on same seed/layout/work; focal ID0 declines vs participates, everyone else willing. Pair Focal0/None holds others declining. No hand-picked focal or favorable cells."
